  "status": "authored 2026-10-08; offline checks only (tools/gym_arenas.py check). Nothing here has been built in a world or seen in a running game.",
  "name": "The Observation Well",
  "reading": "Sabrina's town is the region's place of study (docs/world-building/TOWN_CHARACTER.md gym6_town: it records what the Rift does to memory and perception; calcite, smooth quartz, polished diorite, with purpur and end rods as accents) and she is its Rift researcher. The Hall of Lenses above is where the work is read; under it is where it is observed: a deep observation well, the tallest room of the eight (21 courses clear over the floor against Brock's 14), a vertical room rather than a long one. A great biconvex lens of tinted glass in an amethyst rim hangs from the ceiling on four chains, and its image is let into the floor below it as an amethyst ring round the two Pokemon marks, as the building's own lens floor does. The way down is a stair wound round a quartz newel inside a solid tube that hangs from the ceiling like the barrel of the instrument; it lets out onto a terrace hung fourteen courses over the floor, from which the room is seen whole, the leader small at the far end, before a glass-screened flight takes the player down the east wall to the floor. Sabrina stands on a four-course dais of purpur in a stepped apse at the west end, under THE EYE, the town's sign (purpur, amethyst iris, froglight pupil), lit from behind her.",
  "leader": {"id": "kanto_sabrina", "seat": [6181, 70, 3320], "seat_why": "in the dais top at y70 (floor y66 + 4), at the middle of the apse (z3320, between the dais's z3314..3325) and three in from the dais face (x6184), under the eye. THE ONE SOURCE of Sabrina's seat once this record exists (tools/gym_arenas.py leader_seats): data/gym_buildings/gym6.json leader.spawner (6196, 111, 3312) in the lens chamber is where the building puts the spawner the arena step then moves."},
  "spawn_free_zone": "gym_sabrina",
  "floor_y": 66,
  "bounds": [6176, 64, 3304, 6215, 89, 3335],
  "bounds_why": "the shell, two thick all round and the whole spawn-free zone gym_sabrina (x6176..6215, z3304..3335, so no change to data/spawn_suppression.json): interior x6178..6213 (36), z3306..3333 (28), y67..87 (21 over the floor course y66). The top course y89 leaves y90 and y91 natural under the building's lowest course (y92, the six courses of rock the building re-makes under its pad): COVER = 2, slack 0.",
  "through_building": [{"box": [6199, 90, 3312, 6204, 114, 3317], "why": "the descent tube, x6199..6204 by z3312..3317, from the lens chamber's floor (its first tread at y111, level with the floor course) down through the chamber's floor, the open well, the hall floor, the six courses of rock under the pad and the two natural courses into the room. It stands in the well's free ground: x6199..6204 clear of the decoy stacks D2 (x6194-6195) and D3 (x6199-6200 from z3318), of the gallery's north strip (z3308..3311) and of its east arm (x6205+). Its walls are built y79..110 (the chamber's floor course y111 stays); above y110 only the first treads' headroom is cut (y112..114). The route's waypoints are untouched (the check reads them)."}],
  "entry": {"route_end": [6196, 112, 3312], "floor": [6211, 67, 3326], "why": "route_end is one over Sabrina's spawner today, (6196, 111, 3312) on the lens floor: the end of data/gym_buildings/gym6.json step 4 ('the_lens'). From the chamber the player walks to the stair mouth in the floor at (6200, 111, 3314), winds down 47 treads (31 levels, four turns) inside the tube to the landing (6201, 80, 3313), goes out of the door at (6201, 81..83, 3312) onto the terrace (y80, stand y81) and takes the east flight, 14 stairs down the east wall, onto the floor at (6211, 67, 3326): 30.9 from Sabrina, farther than rctmod's forceBattleMaxDistance + 1, so the player is in the room before she can call the fight. From the terrace Sabrina is 20 or more away (3D) and not in reach."},
  "battle": {"trainer_pokemon": [6190, 65, 3320], "player_pokemon": [6194, 65, 3320], "trainer_stand": [6182, 69, 3320], "player_stand": [6197, 65, 3320], "why": "Cobblemon Battle Positions (a Cobbleverse dependency, already installed), set as GYM_ARENAS.md sets them: one under the floor's top course so spawnHeightOffset 2.0 stands each Pokemon on the floor; the trainer stand under the dais top one in front of the seat. Sabrina's clear radius is 2.09 (slowbro's model sweep) and her tallest is hatterene at 6.13: her Pokemon stands 5.50 from the dais face (3.41 to spare) and the nearest solid within eight courses of either block is 5.50 (trainer) and 8.86 (challenger), measured from the built model. The two are 4 apart (the widest hitbox is 1.53, exeggutor), the challenger's 3 behind its own at the stand. The lens's lowest course is y77, ten over the floor against hatterene's 6.13, and the check's own ceiling is y74."},
  "challenge_spawner": {"old_at": [6194, 111, 3312], "old_restore": {"floor": "minecraft:smooth_quartz", "under": "minecraft:air"}},
